				<r3d:description language="eng">CottonGen is a new cotton community genomics, genetics and breeding database being developed to enable basic, translational and applied research in cotton.  It is being built using the open-source Tripal database infrastructure.  CottonGen consolidates and expands the data from CottonDB and the Cotton Marker Database, providing enhanced tools for easy querying, visualizing and downloading research data.</r3d:description>
